# Project context
- Monorepo: apps/web (Astro), optional apps/tools, packages/{chain,ui,config}
- Use pnpm, TS strict, Tailwind, TanStack Query, Zod, Recharts, Sentry
- All chain/index calls via server /api; no secrets in the browser

# Code style
- Functional React components
- ESLint + Prettier; small diffs (~300 lines) unless a migration is requested
- Strong typing; zod at boundaries

# Architecture rules
- UI never imports blockchain SDKs directly; use packages/chain facade
- /api/* endpoints own remote calls; short cache + optional KV
- Glossary is accessible: <button> triggers, aria-describedby, ESC closes, deep links

# Testing & DX
- Unit tests for adapters; Playwright for /tools flows
- zod-based env validation; fail fast if missing
- Conventional Commits in PRs